    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "What is most interesting about ChatGPT: the result itself, or the way it reframed the problem?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "Instruction-tuned models had already improved compliance with user requests, but they were mostly encountered through APIs and demonstrations. ChatGPT paired that post-training lineage with a persistent dialogue interface and released it as a public research preview.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-chatgpt-instructgpt-background", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "That sounds like a promising direction. What mechanism actually makes it work?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "ChatGPT was trained with supervised dialogue examples and RLHF, with trainers playing both user and assistant roles during data collection. The conversational format lets prior turns become context, supporting follow-up questions, corrections and iterative tasks.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-chatgpt-instructgpt-background", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "Why did the idea outlive one paper or experiment? What did later researchers actually inherit?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "Experts generally treat ChatGPT as the product event that made large language models a mainstream computing interface. Its legacy includes both the acceleration of conversational AI deployment and a much broader debate over hallucination, labor, education, copyright and governance.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-chatgpt-instructgpt-background", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "As today's systems grow larger, which lessons from ChatGPT still matter, and which limits deserve to be questioned again?",
